# Framework auto-overwrite backup (managed by /framework-init)
.framework-backup/

# Skill 6 · hmos-app 真机自动化本地产物（vendor wheel 见 framework/profiles/hmos-app/vendor/hylyre/，须入库）
**/.hylyre/
**/tmp_hypium/
/doc/app-snapshot-cache/
# Hylyre/Hypium 以工程根为 cwd 时落盘的 task 日志；需要归档时再移出 ignore
/reports/

# 根目录工程级 build-profile（个人/本机差异大时需单独提交时再移出 ignore）
/build-profile.json5

# Framework runtime artifacts (managed by /framework-init)
framework/harness/**/ohosTest/
framework/harness/**/test/dag/

# Personal framework settings (per developer, gitignored)
framework.local.json

